# Working on {{module}}

This is a WolOS Crystal project made from the `ai` template. Read the WolOS skill for Crystal apps
(`/usr/share/wolos/crystal/skill/SKILL.md`) before changing it.

- One way to add a tool: a `Tool` entry in `src/tools.cr` and an example in `spec/server_spec.cr`.
- Check before you finish: `make spec`, `make format`, `wol app check`.
- Standard library only. No `system`, no backticks, no shell: a program and its arguments, if ever.
- Standard output carries the protocol. Never `puts` from a tool; return the text.
